{"title":"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The letters <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/4/7c43070a2acf8f4e25d98e48c404d9348a26d40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/0/8d05f6fbac7ae73e8d9f8d14d12b252f176f3eaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{J}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"8\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/9/ad953006c5f452437504cb60640a692211c9d8b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{H}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/9/6d91c8482bbe2cbe3677b5b87313fcefd094a194.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{S}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"8\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/2/f6200a2d5c2ab9c68b6e6ae48c7132f3c8849766.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{M}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a5bb2aa78132b4b716cfde4a9136c884d94c753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{E}$\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" /> and the digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are \"cycled\" separately as follows and put together in a numbered list:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/1/7118a46dde66777eaf400e8ea2209dc386da0af5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}[t]{lccc}  &amp; &amp; AJHSME &amp; 1989 \\\\  &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ 1. &amp; &amp; JHSMEA &amp; 9891 \\\\ 2. &amp; &amp; HSMEAJ &amp; 8919 \\\\ 3. &amp; &amp; SMEAJH &amp; 9198 \\\\  &amp; &amp; ........ &amp;  \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"174\" height=\"111\" />\n</p><p>What is the number of the line on which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/c/f0cc34af48263870cdd8eb892a8e2d7b230e614a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{AJHSME 1989}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"108\" height=\"12\" /> will appear for the first time?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/7/f9736cc4e56d4b16d15926d846cbdc3fc74cbc51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 18 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"367\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/a/73ac96f2ff41e04ce9f12255234587ab72822b64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" /> line includes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/7/7a763f15549e86005c089e55fa0b557983bcd569.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1989$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> while every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/9/f7927a7a7ded192f0d50ad3dbb49c4b97b706774.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\text{th}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" /> line includes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/7/8f7e87146c629ecbfd6b356836a27f4dbf531870.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{AJHSME}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"68\" height=\"12\" />.  Therefore, a line has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/d/d6d99d6a64b9bda68af1d25c794ac7e37598ca53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{AJSHME 1989}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"110\" height=\"13\" /> if and only if its number is divisible by both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Therefore, the number of the first such line is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/1/471a765247ed991e3b66b2ba34cc242ac9513c60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{lcm}(4,6)=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"156\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME\" title=\"1989 AJHSME\">1989 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=19